jsonkit completion · Print or install a shell completion script.

USAGE
  jsonkit completion <command> [options]

COMMANDS
  bash        Print the Bash completion script.
  zsh         Print the Zsh completion script.
  fish        Print the Fish completion script.
  powershell  Print the PowerShell completion script.
  install     Install completion for your shell.
  update      Bring installed completion up to date with this version.
  uninstall   Remove completion from your shell.

GLOBAL OPTIONS
  -h, --help        Show this help.
  -V, --version     Print the version.
  -M, --manifest    Print this command's manifest as JSON.
  -e, --explain     Explain the selected command and exit.
      --[no-]color  Turn color on or off, overriding NO_COLOR.
  -v, --verbose...  Show more detail. Repeat it for more.
  -q, --quiet       Hide info and success messages.

Run jsonkit completion <command> --help for command details.
